      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.94,
      "end_seconds": 160.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.44,
      "end_seconds": 164.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.0,
      "end_seconds": 167.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.33,
      "end_seconds": 178.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "time for your numbers if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.9,
      "end_seconds": 190.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.13,
      "end_seconds": 215.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "okay: temperature is 36.8 degrees, pulse 84, pressure 119 over 70. And respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.13,
      "end_seconds": 218.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.31,
      "end_seconds": 222.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.81,
      "end_seconds": 229.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "I'd like to to check you over now if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.24,
      "end_seconds": 233.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.55,
      "end_seconds": 248.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "the back of both eyes shows swollen optic discs and the visual fields are slightly constricted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.29,
      "end_seconds": 261.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.33,
      "text": "so that's all I needed to check putting it all together my working impression is raised pressure inside the head, possibly idiopathic intracranial hypertension"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.0,
      "end_seconds": 265.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.95,
      "end_seconds": 291.35,
      "duration_seconds": 23.4,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's raised pressure inside the head, possibly idiopathic intracranial hypertension, and we'll watch how it goes let me just check I've got this right you've had a whooshing noise in your ears for about four days, and no head injury or weakness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.6,
      "end_seconds": 293.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.04,
      "end_seconds": 306.79,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "what I'm giving you is acetazolamide 250 milligrams twice a day until review you take it by mouth that's for raised pressure do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.7,
      "end_seconds": 312.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.97,
      "end_seconds": 316.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Book a review in one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.37,
      "end_seconds": 319.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.21,
      "end_seconds": 323.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
